    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Proof. • Step 1: we ﬁrst notice that for every ε > 0 there exists t0 such that if |t| ≤ t0 then u−1(t) ⊆ (u−1(0))ε,"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
