    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "where we use the notation (K)t = { p ∈ Rn | d(p,K) ≤ t }, for the outer parallel set. Indeed, let us assume by contradiction that there exist ε0 > 0 and points yk ∈ u−1(tk) with limk tk = 0 such that"
