    "font" : "SFRM1095",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "• Step 2: We now want to extend the non-degeneracy property of the gradient of u to the functions uj on their level sets u−j 1(0). We notice that by uniform convergence and by the previous step, for every ε > 0 there exist t0 > 0 and j0 such that"
