    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "∀j ≥ j0, u−j 1(0) ⊂ u−1((−t0,t0)) ⊂ (u−1(0))ε. (A.2) On the other hand, ∇u is uniformly continuous in Ω so there exists α0 > 0 such that"
